{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Nommez les 7 personnages du [i]Cluedo[/i]"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"This is the host’s name and he turns up dead."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Grey Poupon, anyone?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"One of them is lighter shade of pale."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"One is always strutting her stuff like some kind of flamboyant bird!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"The grass certainly is THIS on the other side, where you’re not accused of murder."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"One character is certainly a well RED lady."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio","s":"And don’t forget the HOST of the manor!"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
